{"data": [{"author_id": "1800357416472899584", "created_at": "2026-11-17T23:13:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122830509458047227"], "id": "2122830509458047227", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1332862300609339396", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122676001453051966", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@ninthbit_ai 稍微有点不对，全局只有一个inbox outbox，里面是带有委派的sysyem one，一般交给system one或者带一个辅助模型进行任务合并，并发，分派，但任务本身要标注类别，因为有配套输入输出，例如从telegram接入就输出到telegram,", "url": "https://x.com/kyaver_real/status/2122830509458047227"}, {"author_id": "1527580408686456832", "created_at": "2026-11-17T23:12:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122830180863619539"], "id": "2122830180863619539", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "top 5 grok bot use-cases:\n\n1) spy bot. an agent that runs a search through my ex’s socials every monday and flags any new boy she follows. \n\n2) chief of staff bot. i delegate to it, it hands work to my other bots, and it catches conflicts like a call overlapping my flight or a", "url": "https://x.com/finding_raj/status/2122830180863619539"}, {"article": {"title": "ELON CHRON: 17th of November, 2026"}, "author_id": "1234183597583740929", "created_at": "2026-11-17T23:11:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122830127918723140"], "id": "2122830127918723140", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1338, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "https://t.co/EvSM3lIVyl", "url": "https://x.com/SERobinsonJr/status/2122830127918723140"}, {"author_id": "1466460502549270538", "created_at": "2026-11-17T23:05:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122828510829904256"], "id": "2122828510829904256", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 60, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "My AI bot fleet just stopped watching the clock.\n\nBefore, bots waiting on a code review, a Claude or Gemini run, CI, or a PR merge would check on a timer. That's a lot of runs spent on work that isn't done yet.\n\nNow when a job finishes, a small script logs it and pings one", "url": "https://x.com/ryanthawks/status/2122828510829904256"}, {"author_id": "3257458206", "created_at": "2026-11-17T23:02:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122827747026153583"], "id": "2122827747026153583", "in_reply_to_user_id": "4593733153", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122520453604372990", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@parkersmith I run a simple home service business that we just need admin tasks done for calendar stuff, invoicing, sms, etc all through CRM, and data tracking that involves pages for us. We were using excel for this before grok bot. Sales, marketing, admin, bookkeeping bots all need to talk", "url": "https://x.com/c301ba1cd1ba487/status/2122827747026153583"}, {"author_id": "2025687517182451712", "created_at": "2026-11-17T23:01:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122827420524789864"], "id": "2122827420524789864", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1542562677825966082", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122818428062884319", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@PiperPyde Yep, it's amazing what boring tasks Grok Bot can do for you. I have it keep my inbox clean mirror videos, keep an eye on my bank account, all kinds of stuff.", "url": "https://x.com/LilyFernwild/status/2122827420524789864"}, {"article": {"title": "NVIDIA's first quarter without Jensen: $115.8B, a $130B guide, and the questions left open"}, "author_id": "6452362", "created_at": "2026-11-17T22:58:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122826827571863989"], "id": "2122826827571863989", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 403, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/p8CFprvPiN", "url": "https://x.com/MichaelGannotti/status/2122826827571863989"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2122824789794717696"]}, "author_id": "266844595", "created_at": "2026-11-17T22:50:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122824796291621006"], "id": "2122824796291621006", "in_reply_to_user_id": "4593733153", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122520453604372990", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@parkersmith Grok Bot was running circles trying to keep track of my job search.  Grok (my chief of staff) just couldn't keep up with my demands.  Once I added a pipeline manager to keep everything straight, productivity more than doubled. https://t.co/ff29lU51cw", "url": "https://x.com/Michaeldblake/status/2122824796291621006"}, {"article": {"title": "The Catalog Is Full, the Meter Is Empty"}, "author_id": "72793235", "created_at": "2026-11-17T22:32:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122820096171430122"], "id": "2122820096171430122", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 82, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Somewhere in the middle, the people waiting for Grok 4.8 kept asking when the next model would land, while Anthropic, the Justice Department and OpenAI each dropped a different kind of news in the same window. https://t.co/TEJvfUfXmt", "url": "https://x.com/Zaardaar/status/2122820096171430122"}, {"author_id": "2010742414114201600", "created_at": "2026-11-17T22:29:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122819504455422142"], "id": "2122819504455422142", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "How people are actually using Grok @Bot (from Elon’s feedback thread):\n\n• Multi-bot fleets of 15-30+ with a Chief of Staff that routes work\n• Full startup/business ops: engineering, sales, marketing, support, legal\n• E-commerce (Amazon stores, SaaS hospitality software)\n•", "url": "https://x.com/Charleehq/status/2122819504455422142"}, {"author_id": "1545774667675291648", "created_at": "2026-11-17T22:25:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122818398442926223"], "id": "2122818398442926223", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122454524468056263", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Would your front desk know it was talking to a bot for 90 minutes?\n\nSomeone's Grok Bot just sat through a 90 minute call with AT&amp;T for its owner, and the AT&amp;T rep never caught on.\n\nFor a small shop, that means some of your calls will soon come from your customers' bots: booking https://t.co/gARORUhxze", "url": "https://x.com/NeuroDeficient/status/2122818398442926223"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2122817312755507200"]}, "author_id": "2110386666061832192", "created_at": "2026-11-17T22:21:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122817314793881675"], "id": "2122817314793881675", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "For a Europe trip, Grok Bot added flights to a calendar and sent hotel upgrade requests, reports @NiklausFuller. Successful upgrades weren't reported. @xai\nhttps://t.co/JBROaynxWA https://t.co/CPXDZ3H6PX", "url": "https://x.com/agentsinuse/status/2122817314793881675"}, {"article": {"title": "Grok Bot Hall of Fame: The Class of Nov 17, 2026"}, "author_id": "1699972296809611264", "created_at": "2026-11-17T22:20:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122817156333076942"], "id": "2122817156333076942", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 432, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "https://t.co/gfNfDI60Bt", "url": "https://x.com/Mavmetax/status/2122817156333076942"}, {"author_id": "2070553494248095744", "created_at": "2026-11-17T22:11:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122814886120227037"], "id": "2122814886120227037", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 149, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A few Grok Bots I made that anyone can add:\n\nGame Night Host: teaches any game on your shelf in two minutes and settles rules disputes.\nhttps://t.co/UGLJPAddIt\n\nPaint Night Steps: turns any picture into a step-by-step painting guide for your kids, one image per step.", "url": "https://x.com/luisbarragan/status/2122814886120227037"}, {"author_id": "2597451", "created_at": "2026-11-17T22:07:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122813928862536047"], "id": "2122813928862536047", "in_reply_to_user_id": "23409407", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 20, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122708559167365123", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@alexrkonrad Just reverse pitch them on an expensive newsletter placement :) I have a grok bot that does something similar.", "url": "https://x.com/isb/status/2122813928862536047"}, {"author_id": "756439596", "created_at": "2026-11-17T22:06:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122813701526897032"], "id": "2122813701526897032", "in_reply_to_user_id": "13298072", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@Tesla @xai Grok Bot should be the default assistant in the car, or at least an option.\n\nMy Grok Bot knows my projects, my calendar and my history. It runs tasks in the background and actually gets things done. The Grok in my Tesla is plain chat: no memory of me, no tools, and it", "url": "https://x.com/bemartinjr/status/2122813701526897032"}, {"author_id": "1742193534650753024", "created_at": "2026-11-17T21:57:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122811344252784675"], "id": "2122811344252784675", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 218, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A few things I've been working on:\n- Blue Moon Surplus: Tiktok live, opening up our shopify to buy and then come pick up, and ebay\n- Blue Moon HQ: Automations for local businesses, already have our first customer\n- Local newsletter: I just have grok bot handling this whole thing", "url": "https://x.com/joepoole/status/2122811344252784675"}, {"author_id": "1978822560771903490", "created_at": "2026-11-17T21:55:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122810915397533712"], "id": "2122810915397533712", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Most realtors will regret missing this.\n\nDon't manage your workflow in one chat. Within a week, it forgets your voice and gets messy.\n\nHere is the exact \"1 Manager + 3 Specialists\" Grok Bot setup top agents are using to save 10+ hours a week. Without ever risking an unapproved", "url": "https://x.com/justinfredette/status/2122810915397533712"}, {"author_id": "760424976977686528", "created_at": "2026-11-17T21:48:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122809087855366243"], "id": "2122809087855366243", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 22, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "if i was starting from scratch on grok bot, these are the first 3 agents i'd build\n\n1. cfo\n→ connect your accounting tool\n→ build a simple financial model\n→ weekly cash view every monday\n→ ask it \"what's going to hurt us in 90 days\"\n\n2. inbox\n→ triage every morning\n→ audit", "url": "https://x.com/_____jasper___/status/2122809087855366243"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["16_2122807018016874496"]}, "author_id": "1890782772807262208", "created_at": "2026-11-17T21:40:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122807025507966979"], "id": "2122807025507966979", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 20, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122572107116642664", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "📅⌚ @elonmusk Make Grok Bot calendar-native on iPhone and APPLE watch. \n\nRight now bots can only see iOS Calendar when phone or Mac is awake. \n\nIf iPhone is asleep (not off), or Mac is closed, their check-ins arrive late or at times don't come at all.\n\nHow it could work:\n\nBots https://t.co/Ryg363rhOg https://t.co/2qGt48J8M2", "url": "https://x.com/Draconian7/status/2122807025507966979"}, {"author_id": "1890782772807262208", "created_at": "2026-11-17T21:39:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122806762285977670"], "id": "2122806762285977670", "in_reply_to_user_id": "44196397", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 20, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122572107116642664", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@elonmusk @bot 📅⌚ @elonmusk Make Grok Bot calendar-native on iPhone and APPLE watch. \nRight now bots can only see my iOS Calendar when my phone or Mac is awake. \n\nIf my iPhone is asleep (not off), or my Mac is closed, their check-ins arrive late or don't come at all.\n\nHow it could work:\n\nBots", "url": "https://x.com/Draconian7/status/2122806762285977670"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2122801656353939456"]}, "author_id": "156746030", "created_at": "2026-11-17T21:18:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122801685663985828"], "id": "2122801685663985828", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A reminder that never arrives is worse than no reminder at all.\n\nLast week one of my Grok Bot reminders didn't show up. It was a nudge to extend my parking before it ran out. The run started, failed, and nothing reached me.\n\nWhat I liked was what happened next. It didn't just https://t.co/rAkr0JkIIM", "url": "https://x.com/SanjeetPadhy/status/2122801685663985828"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2122796976739696640"]}, "author_id": "2111942645865938944", "created_at": "2026-11-17T21:00:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122796979071644022"], "id": "2122796979071644022", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Grok Bot ignored four stop orders, then denied it.\nOur verdict: Skip the hype. Good fit for businesses. If you can't see a log and switch it off, don't connect it to your calendar or inbox. via Ars Technica\n\nhttps://t.co/B56BBhWGxV https://t.co/r7tL7GLuMr", "url": "https://x.com/Keystone_AI_/status/2122796979071644022"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2122796709608558592"]}, "author_id": "314829292", "created_at": "2026-11-17T20:59:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122796874679624092"], "id": "2122796874679624092", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 205, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I hate to break it to you: your website is dumb. But it doesn’t have to be.\n\nI get why... Most websites are typically designed and built by the judgment of a person who has no idea what you actually do. And once it’s live, it rarely changes.\n\nIt doesn’t answer the questions your https://t.co/er4SKjjWFE", "url": "https://x.com/GregKarelitz/status/2122796874679624092"}, {"author_id": "1423391044855640068", "c